Vnum            501
Name            guard~
ShortDesc       城市守衛~
LongDesc        守護著城市的守衛(guard)在此巡邏。
~
Description
他們是特別在此保護城市的安全﹐正全力專注的看著來往的行人。
~
StayArea        Yes
Effect          'detect invis'
Effect          'detect hidden'
Effect          'sanctuary'
Alignment       100
Level           30
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             -1
Int             -1
Wis             -1
Dex             -1
Con             -1
Hp              3000
Mana            -1
Move            -1
Class           CLASS_FIGHTER
Gold            -1
Multipile       100
AttackRatio     100
DodgeRatio      100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_MALE
AutoEnable      'gdragon steps'

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          100
Text
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimmort($n)
  break
endif
if isenemy($n) != '洛陽'
  mpsetenemy $n '洛陽'
endif
~
End

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          30
Text
if rand(30)
  emote 正到處巡邏著…
  say 不要讓我發現到違反紀律的事﹐否則…嘿嘿…
endif
~
End

End
